  <AltText>
    Reference sheet for our headmate, Rinith. They are an axolotl-kobold hybrid with pink skin/scales, pink gill, dark pink horns, and a pink tail with dark pink scales running down its length, as well as light pink fins. They have red hair, and eyes where the right eye is a dark red and the left eye is a dark yellow. They're wearing a purple layered dress and a translucent blue plaid skirt with a starry sky printed on it. Next to them is their name, Rinith, as well as their pronouns (they/them). Below that are all the colours used.
  </AltText>
